  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Isletme notlari/hatirlatici (kirici, urun migration ister): RecordVisibility (Personal=0, Business=1) ve RecordVisibilityFilter; Note.Visibility, Reminder.Visibility (varsayilan 0) ve indeksler (Visibility, IsPinned) / (Visibility, IsCompleted, DueAt); Notification tekil indeksi AlarmId yerine (AlarmId, OwnerUserId). RecordAccess: erisim kuralinin tek kaynagi (NoteReadable/NoteWritable, ReminderReadable/ReminderWritable, alt madde/alarm/etiket/ek ifadeleri, liste suzgecleri, CanChangeVisibility, RemoveNonOwnerNotificationsAsync); bos kullanici kimligi hicbir satirla eslesmez. Yeni IReminderRecipientResolver (ActiveUserIdsAsync, DisplayNamesAsync): ReminderDispatchService isletme hatirlaticisinda her aktif kullaniciya ayri bildirim uretir (ayni transaction), commit sonrasi alici basina tek push; cozumleyici yoksa ya da bos donerse bildirim uretilmez. DTO'lara Visibility, CreatedByName, IsMine ve Gorunurluk suzgeci eklendi.",
